WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:01.639
This is Lucia.

1
00:00:02.009 --> 00:00:04.369
She is getting ready to start her wrestling season.

2
00:00:05.199 --> 00:00:07.360
She remembers that last season she felt tired

3
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.500
all the time and struggled to make weight.

4
00:00:10.119 --> 00:00:10.720
This season,

5
00:00:10.859 --> 00:00:14.109
her goal is to eat smarter and manage her weight more effectively.

6
00:00:14.489 --> 00:00:18.159
She needs to make the right decisions in order to be on weight but still strong.

7
00:00:21.569 --> 00:00:22.540
Oh no,

8
00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:24.319
I'm 3 pounds heavier.

9
00:00:24.709 --> 00:00:27.520
Will I be able to make weight for my competition in a few days?

10
00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:30.670
I remember hearing my teammates talk about skipping

11
00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.869
meals or wearing sweatsuits to drop weight.

12
00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:33.939
I could try that,

13
00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:34.970
but is it safe?

14
00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:39.490
Lucia reflects on what she just learned about the differences between

15
00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:42.189
